### 🔗 Actual URL Examples for Pharmacy Medicine Filtering

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy

## 💰 PRICE FILTERING URLs

### 1. Price Range: 10-50 currency units
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=50&page=1&limit=10

### 2. Minimum Price: 50+ currency units
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=50&page=1&limit=10

### 3. Maximum Price: Up to 25 currency units
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMax=25&page=1&limit=10

### 4. Budget Medicines: Under 5 currency units (sorted by price)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMax=5&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 5. Premium Medicines: 100+ currency units (sorted by price desc)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=100&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

## 📅 DATE FILTERING URLs

### 6. Medicines added in 2024 (entire year)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10

### 7. Medicines added this year (2024)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&page=1&limit=10

### 8. Medicines added after June 1, 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-06-01&page=1&limit=10

### 9. Medicines added before March 31, 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=10

### 10. Medicines added in November 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&createdDateTo=2024-11-30&page=1&limit=10

### 11. Recent medicines (last 30 days from Nov 19, 2024)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-10-20&page=1&limit=10

## 💰📅 COMBINED PRICE & DATE URLs

### 12. Budget medicines under 20 added in 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMax=20&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 13. Mid-range medicines 20-80 added after May 19, 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=20&priceMax=80&createdDateFrom=2024-05-19&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 14. Expensive medicines 100+ added this month
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=100&createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 15. Medicines 15-60 added in Q1 2024 (Jan-Mar)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=15&priceMax=60&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=12

## 🔍 COMPLEX FILTERING URLs

### 16. Omeprazole medicines 10-50 added in 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?genericName=omeprazole&priceMin=10&priceMax=50&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 17. Vitamin medicines 5-100 added after Oct 1, 2024 with stock 20+
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?name=vitamin&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-10-01&stockMin=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=20

### 18. Category filter + Price + Date
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&page=1&limit=10

### 19. Search by name + Price range + Recent date
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?name=aspirin&priceMin=10&priceMax=30&createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&page=1&limit=10

### 20. All filters combined
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?query=anti&category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&stockMin=10&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

## 📋 Parameter Reference

### Price Parameters:
- `priceMin=10` - Minimum price (inclusive)
- `priceMax=50` - Maximum price (inclusive)

### Date Parameters:
- `createdDateFrom=2024-01-01` - Start date (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- `createdDateTo=2024-12-31` - End date (YYYY-MM-DD format)

### Other Useful Parameters:
- `genericName=omeprazole` - Filter by generic name
- `name=aspirin` - Filter by medicine name
- `category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde` - Filter by category ID
- `stockMin=10` - Minimum stock quantity
- `stockMax=500` - Maximum stock quantity
- `sortBy=price` - Sort by: name, genericName, price, stock, createdAt
- `sortOrder=asc` - Sort order: asc, desc
- `page=1` - Page number
- `limit=10` - Items per page

### 🔧 Usage Notes:
- All parameters are optional
- Combine multiple parameters with `&`
- Date format: YYYY-MM-DD
- Price accepts decimal values
- Case-insensitive text search